{"paragraphs":[{"text":"%md\n# Capstone","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-10T16:31:45+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h1>Capstone</h1>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762714528079_1297707509","id":"paragraph_1762714528079_1297707509","dateCreated":"2025-11-09T18:55:28+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-10T16:31:45+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-10T16:31:45+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true},{"text":"%md\n### Import packages and set local time.\nSince these files are oriententet around Norwegian timezone, we configure this note book to opreate with the timezone \"Europe/Oslo\". This will make the `TimestampType` give the right time allocation for Timestamp data.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-10T18:02:07+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Import packages and set local time.</h3>\n<p>Since these files are oriententet around Norwegian timezone, we configure this note book to opreate with the timezone &ldquo;Europe/Oslo&rdquo;. This will make the <code>TimestampType</code> give the right time allocation for Timestamp data.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762797225883_263168143","id":"paragraph_1762797225883_263168143","dateCreated":"2025-11-10T17:53:45+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-10T18:02:07+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-10T18:02:07+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%spark\r\nimport spark.implicits._\r\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.types._\r\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.expressions._\r\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions._ \r\n\r\n// Sett timezone to NO\r\nspark.conf.set(\"spark.sql.session.timeZone\", \"Europe/Oslo\")\r\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-11T12:53:57+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"editorHide":false},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"import spark.implicits._\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.types._\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.expressions._\nimport org.apache.spark.sql.functions._\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762714155530_1600241643","id":"paragraph_1762714155530_1600241643","dateCreated":"2025-11-09T18:49:15+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-11T12:53:57+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-11T12:55:41+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":false},{"text":"%md\n### Define file locations and build Schema for Dataframes.\n\n#### Define data source.\nFirst we'll define the location of the different datasets we're going to import.  \nAll data files used in this project is collected from `.csv` files.  \nThis will be defined with several relative paths. Meaning that that there are different paths to different sources, but their all confined within the `sparkio` local enviroment directory.  \nFile import will be done recursively, so each source path is defined with `*.csv` at the lowest level to include all csv files in the given path.  \n\n#### Schemas.\nSince we're importing csv files it's necessary to predifine **Schemas** for the different imports.  \nWe'll create one schmea for trafic related files, since they all have the same data structure.  \nWe'll create a separate schema for weather data.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-10T21:35:51+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>Define file locations and build Schema for Dataframes.</h3>\n<h4>Define data source.</h4>\n<p>First we&rsquo;ll define the location of the different datasets we&rsquo;re going to import.<br />\nAll data files used in this project is collected from <code>.csv</code> files.<br />\nThis will be defined with several relative paths. Meaning that that there are different paths to different sources, but their all confined within the <code>sparkio</code> local enviroment directory.<br />\nFile import will be done recursively, so each source path is defined with <code>*.csv</code> at the lowest level to include all csv files in the given path.</p>\n<h4>Schemas.</h4>\n<p>Since we&rsquo;re importing csv files it&rsquo;s necessary to predifine <strong>Schemas</strong> for the different imports.<br />\nWe&rsquo;ll create one schmea for trafic related files, since they all have the same data structure.<br />\nWe&rsquo;ll create a separate schema for weather data.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762797397299_806898811","id":"paragraph_1762797397299_806898811","dateCreated":"2025-11-10T17:56:37+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-10T21:35:51+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-10T21:35:57+0000","status":"FINISHED"},{"text":"%spark\nval bil_base = \"/sparkio/trafikkdata/bil/*.csv\"\nval sykkel_base = \"/sparkio/trafikkdata/sykkel/*.csv\"\nval weather_base = \"/sparkio/værdata/*.csv\"\n\nval trafikk_Schema = StructType(Array(\n    StructField(\"trafikkregistreringspunkt\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"navn\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"vegreferanse\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"fra\", TimestampType, true),\n\tStructField(\"til\", TimestampType, true),\n\tStructField(\"dato\", DateType, true),\n\tStructField(\"fra tidspunkt\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"til tidspunkt\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"felt\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"trafikkmengde\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\"dekningsgrad (%)\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"antall timer total\", ByteType, true),\n\tStructField(\"antall timer inkludert\", ByteType, true),\n\tStructField(\"antall timer ugyldig\", ByteType, true),\n\tStructField(\"ikke gyldig lengde\", ByteType, true),\n\tStructField(\"lengdekvalitetsgrad (%)\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"< 5,6m\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\">= 5,6m\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\"5,6m - 7,6m\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\"7,6m - 12,5m\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\"12,5m - 16,0m\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\">= 16,0m\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\"16,0m - 24,0m\", ShortType, true),\n\tStructField(\">= 24,0m\", ShortType, true)\n))\n\nval weather_Schema = StructType(Array(\n    StructField(\"navn\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"stasjon\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"tid(norsk normaltid)\", TimestampType, true),\n\tStructField(\"nedbør (1 t)\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"lufttemperatur\", StringType, true),\n\tStructField(\"høyeste middelvind (1 t)\", StringType, true)\n))","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-11T12:54:33+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"editorHide":false},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"\u001b[1m\u001b[34mbil_base\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32mString\u001b[0m = /sparkio/trafikkdata/bil/*.csv\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34msykkel_base\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32mString\u001b[0m = /sparkio/trafikkdata/sykkel/*.csv\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mweather_base\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32mString\u001b[0m = /sparkio/værdata/*.csv\n\u001b[1m\u001b[34mtrafikk_Schema\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m\u001b[32morg.apache.spark.sql.types.StructType\u001b[0m = StructType(StructField(trafikkregistreringspunkt,StringType,true),StructField(navn,StringType,true),StructField(vegreferanse,StringType,true),StructField(fra,TimestampType,true),StructField(til,TimestampType,true),StructField(dato,DateType,true),StructField(fra tidspunkt,StringType,true),StructField(til tidspunkt,StringType,true),StructField(felt,StringType,true),StructField(trafikkmengde,ShortType,true),StructField(dekningsgrad (%),StringType,true),StructField(antall timer total,...\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762719376207_1791722203","id":"paragraph_1762719376207_1791722203","dateCreated":"2025-11-09T20:16:16+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-11T12:55:41+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-11T12:55:44+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":false},{"text":"%spark\nval bil_raw_df = spark.read\n    .option(\"header\", true)\n    .option(\"recursiveFileLookup\", true)\n    .schema(trafikk_Schema)\n    .option(\"delimiter\", \";\")\n    .option(\"nullValue\", \"-\")\n    .option(\"timestampFormat\", \"yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mmXXX\")    \n    .csv(bil_base)\n\nval bil_raw = bil_raw_df.withColumn(\"klasse\", lit(0).cast(ByteType))\n\nbil_raw.show(3, truncate = false)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-11T12:56:28+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"editorHide":false},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"+-------------------------+---------------+----------------+-------------------+-------------------+------